uropean nations. Efforts are being made to restore grain exports through the Black Sea, which have significantly declined. Additionally, the safety of energy infrastructure and fuel shipments is a major concern amid the ongoing conflict. Different interpretations of energy infrastructure complicate discussions on protection measures.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-trying-to-bring-russia-ukraine-europe-to-the-table-on-3-fronts-jaishankar/articleshow/135427332.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-trying-to-bring-russia-ukraine-europe-to-the-table-on-3-fronts-jaishankar/articleshow/135427332.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T17:54:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135427380,imgsize-131472.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Super flop rally': BJP says Ramlila Maidan '40% empty', mocks INDIA bloc protest]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/super-flop-rally-bjp-says-ramlila-maidan-40-empty-mocks-india-bloc-protest/articleshow/135426536.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135426536.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/super-flop-rally-bjp-says-ramlila-maidan-40-empty-mocks-india-bloc-protest/articleshow/135426536.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/super-flop-rally-bjp-says-ramlila-maidan-40-empty-mocks-india-bloc-protest/articleshow/135426536.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T17:27:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135426660,imgsize-1001373.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rahul's Ramlila 'jalsa' to 'rub salt in wounds' of 1984 Sikh riot victims: Amit Shah]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahuls-ramlila-jalsa-to-rub-salt-in-wounds-of-1984-sikh-riot-victims-amit-shah/articleshow/135423470.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135423470.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Union home minister Amit Shah said the "jalsa" would reopen painful memories for the victims and their families, accusing the Congress of showing little sensitivity towards the tragedy. Shah made the remarks in Chandigarh while addressing a gathering after inaugurating and laying the foundation stones for development projects worth Rs 258 crore.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahuls-ramlila-jalsa-to-rub-salt-in-wounds-of-1984-sikh-riot-victims-amit-shah/articleshow/135423470.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahuls-ramlila-jalsa-to-rub-salt-in-wounds-of-1984-sikh-riot-victims-amit-shah/articleshow/135423470.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T16:45:29+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135425486,imgsize-109382.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Stay quiet or I'll speak for an hour': Kharge's playful warning to supporters at Ramlila Maidan rally]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stay-quiet-or-ill-speak-for-an-hour-kharges-playful-warning-to-supporters-at-ramlila-maidan-rally/articleshow/135425070.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135425070.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/stay-quiet-or-ill-speak-for-an-hour-kharges-playfu