space="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135424656.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[During a rally at Ramlila Maidan on Sunday, senior leaders from the INDIA coalition raised alarms about electoral roll manipulation. They accused the BJP of endangering democracy through the Chief Election Commissioner. Opposition leaders like Rahul Gandhi and Mamata Banerjee demanded Gyanesh Kumar's removal and vowed to continue their campaign against him.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-rally-mamata-mocks-gyanesh-kumar-akhilesh-says-parivartan-can-come-anytime-who-said-what/articleshow/135424656.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/india-bloc-rally-mamata-mocks-gyanesh-kumar-akhilesh-says-parivartan-can-come-anytime-who-said-what/articleshow/135424656.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T16:17:43+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Kanchan Yadav</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135425899,imgsize-100732.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Will dig you out from ground, if needed’: Kharge warns CEC Gyanesh Kumar at INDIA bloc rally]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-dig-you-out-from-ground-if-needed-kharge-warns-cec-gyanesh-kumar-at-india-bloc-rally/articleshow/135424349.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135424349.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-dig-you-out-from-ground-if-needed-kharge-warns-cec-gyanesh-kumar-at-india-bloc-rally/articleshow/135424349.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/will-dig-you-out-from-ground-if-needed-kharge-warns-cec-gyanesh-kumar-at-india-bloc-rally/articleshow/135424349.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T16:04:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135424543,imgsize-76810.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘Did they really have to choose this day?’ BJP targets Congress over INDIA bloc rally on anniversary of 1984 riots]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/did-they-really-have-to-choose-this-day-bjp-targets-congress-over-india-bloc-rally-on-anniversary-of-1984-riots/articleshow/135423866.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135423866.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[BJP organized a protest march in West Delhi's Hari Nagar demanding an apology from Congress for the 1984 anti-Sikh violence. Union minister Hardeep Singh Puri described the killings as a well-planned genocide rather than a riot. Several leaders participated in the march, expressing concerns over Congress's perceived failure to acknowledge the tragedy. The protest coincided with the opposition's rally addressing electoral irregularities on the same day.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/did-they-really-have-to-choose-this-day-bjp-targets-congress-over-india-bloc-rally-on-anniversary-of-1984-riots/articleshow/135423866.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/did-they-really-have-to-choose-this-day-bjp-targets-congress-over-india-bloc-rally-on-anniversary-of-1984-riots/articleshow/135423866.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-01T15:56:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135424262,imgsize-1248694.cms"/></item></channel></rss>